zuproto bundles third-party code in src/vendor/. src/vendor/PROVENANCE
records the upstream release, commit, file hashes and local patches.

upb (src/vendor/upb/)

  The upb runtime of Protocol Buffers, as the amalgamation protobuf ships
  for its Ruby extension (ruby/ext/google/protobuf_c/ruby-upb.{c,h}).
